{"title": "Opportune Predator", "pageid": 30102, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Opportune_Predator", "categories": ["Passive features", "Pages using deprecated parameters"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Generic_Wild_Animal.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4f/Generic_Wild_Animal.webp/300px-Generic_Wild_Animal.webp, /w/images/4/4f/Generic_Wild_Animal.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4f/Generic_Wild_Animal.webp/300px-Generic_Wild_Animal.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/4f/Generic_Wild_Animal.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Opportune Predator</b> is a passive feature that allows a <a href=\"/wiki/Displacer_beast_(illusion)\" title=\"Displacer beast (illusion)\">displacer beast illusion</a> to pre-emptively attack enemies that move near them.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>When an entity enters your attack range, you can strike them. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Displacer_beast_(illusion)\" title=\"Displacer beast (illusion)\">Displacer beast (illusion)</a></li></ul>\n</div>      \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715114824\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.021 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.025 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 453/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 15